tive comparison point and further demonstrate the efficiency of our SP-based selection strategy.\n\nWe believe the core novelty—formulating and solving the sparse black-box attack problem for LLM-based forecasting—is sound and significant. The experimental results across multiple models and datasets robustly demonstrate the vulnerability. We will strengthen the paper by: 1) Adding a more detailed justification of the algorithm's convergence properties in Section 5.2, 2) Expanding the related work to clearly differentiate our black-box setting from white-box sparse attacks, and 3) Incorporating a new black-box sparse baseline (e.g., random search) in the experiments to provide a more comprehensive evaluation."
